                                                "sense_id": "67410905-0938-3de7-bf65-adf17a2fedc6",
                                                "text": "Generator excitation is obtained by a combination of the separately-excited and self-excited fields, and the output is controlled by a resistance in the separate field circuit adjusted by the load regulator under the control of the engine governor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c530a0c-874e-4898-a825-ba8c3dca4835",
                                                "sense_id": "67410905-0938-3de7-bf65-adf17a2fedc6",
                                                "text": "Wheelslip automatically causes the main generator field excitation to be reduced; the load regulator is forced back to minimum excitation and, if operating in one of the two stages of traction motor field divert, causes reversion to full field."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23b155b5-0dda-3a27-b060-bc3be0e7f708",
                                        "entry_id": "90173339-811c-344d-b6c1-1a5517652f5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of producing excitement (stimulation); also, the excitement produced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ffbb3a1-b831-4068-bab2-29a8ebaff0ae",
                                                "sense_id": "23b155b5-0dda-3a27-b060-bc3be0e7f708",
                                                "text": "Baiae: An ancient Roman pleasure resort [...]. It was the focal point of all kinds fo erotic experiments, unbridled debauchery, amorous intrigues and excitations, sexual encounters and aberrations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c352e121-5ac0-4f92-8c7d-22be807ca3b9",
                                                "sense_id": "23b155b5-0dda-3a27-b060-bc3be0e7f708",
                                                "text": "I'm pickin' up good vibrations / She's giving me the excitations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85ea7e11-9fa1-476f-9fa2-43268af24465",
                                                "sense_id": "23b155b5-0dda-3a27-b060-bc3be0e7f708",
                                                "text": "The erotics of composition are essential to the process, some prereflective excitation and orientation, some sense that your own little verse-craft can dock safe and sound at the big quay of language."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a003819-b22e-3285-9684-a3f308d08bdf",
                                        "entry_id": "90173339-811c-344d-b6c1-1a5517652f5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The activity produced in an organ, tissue, or part, such as a nerve cell, as a result of stimulation."
